# Quant Terminal · World Monitor Bridge V2.11
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Goal
# - Keep global_event_map.py V2.10.6R as a stable fallback.
# - Stop append-only patch accumulation.
# - Build a clean, exact layer registry from the original World Monitor
#   TypeScript/config files and optional ZIP archives.
# - Render one Plotly trace per exact layer so the drawer cannot leak
#   unrelated objects into selected layers.
# - Reuse existing Python live providers when global_event_map.py is present.
#
# Integration:
#   from worldmonitor_bridge_v211 import render_worldmonitor_bridge_v211
#   render_worldmonitor_bridge_v211()
# ============================================================

