# === WM211 MAP EVENT WINDOW DESIGN SKIN V2.11.17 END ===

# === WM211 COUNTRY + DESIGN NATIVE NAVIGATION V2.11.21 START ===
# Final native navigation + country focus repair.
#
# Why V2.11.20 was only partially sufficient:
# - it removed browser-level navigation, which stopped the extra Quant Terminal
#   windows and Jarvis route resets;
# - however the UI still depended on Streamlit's segmented/radio rendering, so
#   the visual skin degraded and the country action was not explicit enough;
# - country state was passed downstream but not forcefully reflected in the map
#   data envelope, so some countries looked unchanged.
#
# V2.11.21 keeps the safe model: no href, no target, no location.replace.
# Controls are true Streamlit buttons. A click mutates session_state and reruns
# in the same session. Country selection now affects: session mirror, map focus,
# focus marker, optional country envelope filter, and panel runtime input.

